    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>Conquest of Kings</strong> blends deep turn-based strategy with fast-paced, 30-60 minute battles! Compete in <strong>1v1 duels</strong> or intense <strong>4 player free-for-alls</strong>, capturing the <strong>Sacred Sites</strong> to claim victory! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit</strong> units, <strong>command</strong> powerful armies, and play devastating <strong>cards</strong> to turn the tide of battle!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Strategy -</strong> Deep tactical decisions in a 30-60 minute game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online PVP -</strong> 1v1s, 2v2, 4-Player FFA.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command Powerful Armies -</strong> Recruit from five unit types and seize control of key tiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn the Favor of the Gods -</strong> Pay tribute to the Gods to gain powerful bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Powerful Cards</strong> - Play cards from your hand to influence battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/5c65af56b52bdefc8e8da349a346e6a4.avif?t=1742012281\" data-has-big width=800 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/92755ea164a3a9acd59b2b3ecf1b39c3.avif?t=1742012281\" data-has-big width=800 height=737 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/15a557afcda64dbe24d29b49065e4dfa.avif?t=1742012281\" data-has-big width=800 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RECRUIT AND COMMAND POWERFUL ARMIES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units can sharing a tile to form an Army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically position troops to seize tiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leverage unit strengths and weakness to dominate your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/812a913a8d4761bd8300be9aafce9428.avif?t=1742012281\" data-has-big width=800 height=511 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/069ee37538ce40b55fffb7b78f75a5d3.poster.avif?t=1742012281\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/069ee37538ce40b55fffb7b78f75a5d3.webm?t=1742012281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/069ee37538ce40b55fffb7b78f75a5d3.mp4?t=1742012281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/94a6699e0b814616d8d417fec57ca6b8.avif?t=1742012281\" data-has-big width=800 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAPTURE KEY TILES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps consist of tiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the Sacred Sites to secure victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farms and Mines offer economic bonuses crucial for success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consider terrain during battles, as certain tiles grant advantages to attackers or defenders.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/d247bb38d3650a1c5c39d8e759f97e1c.avif?t=1742012281\" data-has-big width=800 height=531 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/ed04471c4c3678bc0f723f01fb62be00.poster.avif?t=1742012281\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/ed04471c4c3678bc0f723f01fb62be00.webm?t=1742012281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/ed04471c4c3678bc0f723f01fb62be00.mp4?t=1742012281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/f7e0010137decdfecf18bcc0c4878f8c.avif?t=1742012281\" data-has-big width=800 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMMAND YOUR TROOPS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning of every round, each Army requires a Command.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commands provide direction to your forces and are resolved one at a time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For instance, if you issue two &quot;Movement&quot; commands, you can opt to execute one on your initial turn and the second on the following turn. </p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This strategic approach allows for careful planning and execution of maneuvers throughout the game. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/c58c2310e0847dea46805a589fb4d99b.avif?t=1742012281\" data-has-big width=800 height=531 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/0d60806a9243c49bf7e4fd7827c465c4.poster.avif?t=1742012281\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/0d60806a9243c49bf7e4fd7827c465c4.webm?t=1742012281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/0d60806a9243c49bf7e4fd7827c465c4.mp4?t=1742012281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/e6dd71140ec47cd55f8bfdeae0cdbf3c.avif?t=1742012281\" data-has-big width=800 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY CARDS DURING BATTLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical decisions extend beyond the battlefield - cards give you the power to shift the tide of battle with strategic plays.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cards from your hand to sway the outcome of battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's bolstering attacks, fortifying defenses, or unleashing game-changing effects, the power is in your hands. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember, each card played is discarded until your hand is depleted, so choose your moves wisely.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your hand is empty, you'll have the opportunity to replenish it and continue the fight! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/8ab9c55fb5b3409539c536a32cd3c86f.avif?t=1742012281\" width=620 height=664 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/7e92d8e8d043e3926eeeae18669c49fd.poster.avif?t=1742012281\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/7e92d8e8d043e3926eeeae18669c49fd.webm?t=1742012281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/7e92d8e8d043e3926eeeae18669c49fd.mp4?t=1742012281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/3cf40464127449c8649659f47c4ee063.avif?t=1742012281\" data-has-big width=800 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GIVE TRIBUTES TO THE GODS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay gold tributes to gain <strong>bonuses</strong> from the Gods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gods <strong>favor those who honor them</strong> and may <strong>penalize those who disregard their influence</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bid for influence <strong>against your opponents</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weigh your options carefully. Consider the bonuses you seek and the penalties you can bear. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With gold is a finite resource, it's essential to choose your tributes wisely, ensuring optimal outcomes for your endeavors. </p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep in mind that your opponents may offer differing amounts of gold in tribute, further complicating your decisions. Remember, the Gods favor those who offer the most!  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/54f07a097ae814b48cc1906e0b49da75.avif?t=1742012281\" data-has-big width=800 height=527 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Discord to stay up-to-date with development progress and provide me with feedback!</p>",
