ntial to choose your tributes wisely, ensuring optimal outcomes for your endeavors. </p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep in mind that your opponents may offer differing amounts of gold in tribute, further complicating your decisions. Remember, the Gods favor those who offer the most!  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883410/extras/54f07a097ae814b48cc1906e0b49da75.avif?t=1742012281\" data-has-big width=800 height=527 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Discord to stay up-to-date with development progress and provide me with feedback!</p>",
